				<video class="jdn-vp__media" playsinline preload="metadata" controlslist="nodownload" controls poster="https://www.jdn.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jdn-poster-20261125-073611.jpg" aria-label="שמחה רוטמן"><source src="https://www.jdn.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/WhatsApp-Video-2026-11-25-at-09.03.11.mp4" type="video/mp4"></video>								<a class="jdn-vp__logo jdn-vp__logo--top-start" href="https://www.jdn.co.il" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img decoding="async" src="https://www.jdn.co.il/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/logosite.png" alt="לוגו"></a>				<div class="jdn-vp__ad" hidden>
